We are proud of the high reviews our hotel receives. To continue to surprise our guests, we are looking for a colleague who contributes to their experience with great enthusiasm.What are we looking for?
• You are flexible. The schedule varies in terms of times and days. We take your wishes into account;
• You have experience working in the kitchen/have completed a chef's training;
• You can work independently;
• You have knowledge of HACCP;
• You speak Dutch and English.Where will you work?Inntel Hotels Amsterdam Landmark has a tough character that is inspired by the industrial past of the area. It is the place to spend the night, dine in Bar & Brasserie Werkspoor, organize business events and completely unwind in Spa Steam. The wellness centre has a swimming pool, Turkish bath, sauna and massage room. In addition, all luxury room types are equipped with a round whirlpool in the room and/or a private sauna.

As an Fulltime Order Picker at GXO in Roosendaal, you will start with a gross hourly wage of €14.99, plus shift allowances of up to 50%, meaning your hourly wage can increase to €22.49 per hour. This makes working as an Order Picker  / Warehouse EMployee especially attractive!

In this role, you will pick and check orders, prepare them for shipment and make sure everything leaves the warehouse on time. You will work with an English voice-picking system and an electric pallet truck (EPT).

Every day, you will start together with your team during the daily briefing in Roosendaal, conveniently located near  Breda, Etten-Leur and Bergen op Zoom. After that, you will get to work: picking orders, wrapping and packing goods, unloading containers and stacking pallets. You will accurately process everything you do in the WMS system.

You will work in a two-shift system:

06:00 – 14:45

14:45 – 23:30

You can work full-time (40 hours) or part-time (from 32 hours). You are also available to work an average of 2 Saturdays per month.

Thanks to your efforts as an Order Picker, Warehouse Employee or Logistics Employee, the warehouse runs smoothly and customers receive their orders on time. The GXO location in Roosendaal is easily accessible from Breda, Etten-Leur and Bergen op Zoom.

You are ready for an active job as an Order Picker / Logistics Employee in Roosendaal?

- You are physically fit, comfortable lifting up to 20 kg, and you speak and understand English well;
- You already have experience as an Order Picker, Warehouse Employee or Logistics Employee;
- You are available for at least 4 days per week, are flexible and don't mind working 2 Saturdays per month;
- An EPT certificate is a plus, but it is not required;
- You enjoy working as part of a team, take initiative and are eager to learn and develop yourself;
